d from 1951 to 2025 shows August to September and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. In 2025, October to November ran 41% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 50% and April to May at 59% on the middle. Grid 20606 had its driest year in 1963 at 61%.</p>"}
